{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124015","id":4684809832,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFzyGaA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124015","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124015.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124015.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124015","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124015/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124015/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124015/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5762a52de280f63b4efeaea1e82114dfcde1fc61","number":124015,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"LibGodot: Refactor GLES embedding support","user":{"login":"kisg","id":406832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjgzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg","html_url":"https://github.com/kisg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR refactors GLES  initialization and framebuffer binding in ways that have been useful for us when working with various LibGodot projects:\r\n\r\n* EGLManager becomes a subclass of GLManager\r\n* This GLManager hierarchy can thus be used with both EGL and non-EGL setups.\r\n  * Subsequent PRs will introduce GLManagers on Apple and Android platforms which also use this same hierarchy.\r\n* This change also adds support for using ANGLE built as a shared library.\r\n* We also extended GLAD, so the GL library names can be customized, and the library loaded using GLAD can also be unloaded.\r\n  * This made it possible to load one GL library, check its capabilities, unload it and then load another library (specifically ANGLE) as a fallback.\r\n\r\nAll this refactoring work made it possible to handle GL renderers in a unified way in the embedded DisplayServer (when Godot UI is embedded into a host application's UI in a subsequent PR.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by [Migeran](https://migeran.com)\r\nSponsored by [Xibbon Inc.](https://xibbon.com).\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## References\r\n\r\nThis is the next part of the LibGodot feature.\r\nOriginal feature: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90510\r\nMerged PRs:\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110863\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123717","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"